<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deme</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sie</unclear> die supplicanten unsre bur-
<lb n="17"/>gere mit ihrem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beklagten</unclear> bericht
<lb n="18"/>nit content sijn koennen noch woellen,
