<lb n="37"/>Daran beschicht, was den rechten und
<lb n="38"/>der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">billigkeit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemeß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ist</unclear>, so wir gegen
